    {
      "id": "p0098-b002",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "Theory: Mt. Ebott is in the United States because the game references the USDA. Toby’s response when I asked: “USDA could be UNDERGROUND SALAD DEMON ASSOCIATION”",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.1135358,
          0.0907143,
          0.2751452,
          0.2157143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.1135358,
          0.0907143,
          0.2751452,
          0.2157143
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "有人推测：游戏提到 USDA（美国农业部），所以 Mt. Ebott 在美国。我问 Toby，他回答：“USDA 也可以是 UNDERGROUND SALAD DEMON ASSOCIATION（地下沙拉恶魔协会）。”",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
