    {
      "id": "p0098-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Generalizing the description like this makes the original “in-group joke” more accessible to Japanese players. In fact, this new description could conceivably work in any country in the world!",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2915108,
          0.4464286,
          0.9144232,
          0.5021429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2915108,
          0.4464286,
          0.9144232,
          0.5021429
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "把说明改得更通用后，日本玩家也更容易理解原先的“圈内笑话”。事实上，这段新说明大概放在世界上任何国家都能成立！",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
