    {
      "id": "p0098-b010",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "Pop culture references are always a problem, even before translation gets involved – not everyone will get them to begin with, and they grow more dated with every passing minute",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.1196728,
          0.5485714,
          0.2751452,
          0.6742857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.1196728,
          0.5485714,
          0.2751452,
          0.6742857
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "流行文化典故总会带来麻烦，甚至还没到翻译这一步就已经如此：本来就不是人人都懂，而且时间每过一分，它们就又过时了一点。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
