    {
      "id": "p0098-b013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby pointed out in his notes that “for your health” is a reference to Dr. Steve Brule’s catchphrase from the American comedy television programs Tim and Eric Awesome Show, Great Job! and Check It Out! with Dr. Steve Brule. He also noted that it wasn’t important to include a similar reference in the Japanese script, so the translator gave the line a straightforward translation:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2915108,
          0.74,
          0.915446,
          0.8321429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2915108,
          0.74,
          0.915446,
          0.8321429
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Toby 在备注中指出，“for your health”是美国喜剧节目 Tim and Eric Awesome Show, Great Job! 及 Check It Out! with Dr. Steve Brule 中，Dr. Steve Brule 的口头禅。他也说明，日文稿不必加入类似的典故，所以译者采用直译，日版大意是：",
        "status": "draft",
